00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
Av hewşa jî kevnar e teb'en.
 
This courtyard is also ancient, naturally.

121
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,000
Seke kevrê ginde. Qaling e.
 
Look at the big stones. It is thick.

122
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:33,000
Pêncî santîmî qaling e.
 
It is fifty centimeters thick.

123
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Jûr jî heye kevn e, hedimî ye. Jûr jêr jî heye.
 
There is a room too, it is old, it has collapsed. There is a
room below as well.

124
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:39,000
Maşalla. Hem gîştin navçê ha.
 
Mashallah. We all reached the center.

125
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:45,000
Hav holê nu hem gîştin navçê, li çê bigre ha vî li min çê
bigre.
 
Like this, we all reached the center, film this, film me.

126
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:51,000
O no. Wîn hebana no... yê kindiyê marê ber vê kelomê no
çawîk xwe çêkira.
 
Oh look. If you were here... the [snake's corner] before
these old ruins made its nest.

127
00:21:51,000 --> 00:22:09,000
Paş jî li pişî ta bo e pirrn bo.
 
Then [unclear]...

128
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:13,000
Erê xokoman, teb'en hav malbata te ye.
 
Yes folks, naturally this is your family's.

129
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:16,000
Malbata te esasî bes kevnar e xirabe ye.
 
Your main family [home], but it is ancient and ruined.

130
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:19,000
Ma jûr va tara lextok çêkir.
 
We fixed up the upper room a little bit.

131
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:24,000
Zikryatê te têda pirr ne.
 
There are many memories of yours in it.

132
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:30,000
Erê xokê me jî li vî derê hewşê ko Hacer ew dikê, fiqare.
 
Yes, our folks are also here in the courtyard that Hacer is
[cleaning], the poor thing.

133
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:35,000
...a di gundiyê vê... li vê ortê, li vê çoyî da.
 
...of this village... in this middle, in this place.

134
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:38,000
Fiqara wele çatine, dîkan tinene, kahraba tinene.
 
Poor things, by God it is hard, there are no shops, there is
no electricity.

135
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:44,000
Ya heram. O vê hewşa jî ge xirabe ye, havşê kevnar e.
 
What a pity. And this courtyard is also very ruined, an
ancient courtyard.

136
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:47,000
Erê xokoman, me ewte dilî ta kir.
 
Yes folks, we did what your heart desired.

137
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:51,000
Saeta ta xweş. Îşalla me teqsîr nekirbinê.
 
Bless you. God willing, we haven't been negligent.

138
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:54,000
De êj mistê me derket me kir.
 
We did whatever came from our hands.

139
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:57,000
Erê xokoman, wekî dibê, emê vîdyo xwe li vir xîtam kin.
 
Yes folks, as they say, we will conclude our video here.

140
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:59,000
Saeta we xweş. Kesê di me sêr dike,
 
Bless you. Those who watch us,

141
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:03,000
bîr nekin helek çor pênc te'lîqa yaz mîş kin o.
 
don't forget to write about four or five comments.

142
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:07,000
Emê vîdyo xwe li vir xîtam kin. Saeta we xweş, çavê hemoş
dikim.
 
We will conclude our video here. Bless you, I kiss
everyone's eyes.

143
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,000
Û xîtamê me jî li vire. Boy boy kin cema'et.
 
And our conclusion is here. Say bye bye, guys.

144
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:12,000
Boy boy. Bi me ra bin vîdyo kî din xweş, Hacer.
 
Bye bye. Be with us in another nice video, Hacer.

145
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:26,000
Saetekî ya xweş. Kesê di me sêr dikin.
 
Have a good time. Those who watch us.

146
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:31,000
Saeta we xweş. Xwedê ji we razî be.
 
Bless you. May God be pleased with you.

